00:12:21.922 --> 00:12:23.575
you start to show up and make the effort,

00:12:23.575 --> 00:12:24.854
but at the end of the day,

00:12:24.854 --> 00:12:28.354
whatever it is that you want to happen:

00:12:28.354 --> 00:12:29.836
It's great that you want it to happen,

00:12:29.836 --> 00:12:30.923
it's great that you're working for it,

00:12:30.923 --> 00:12:33.175
but you can't have the
expectation that just because

00:12:33.175 --> 00:12:37.086
you work hard, that anyone should care.

00:12:37.086 --> 00:12:38.243
Like what's in it for them?

00:12:38.243 --> 00:12:41.409
I think no one believes in
that anymore like, what's

00:12:41.409 --> 00:12:42.242
in it for the other person? What are

00:12:42.242 --> 00:12:45.075
they getting out of this interaction?

00:12:45.075 --> 00:12:47.274
Because I think if people
thought about what's in it

00:12:47.274 --> 00:12:48.827
for the other person when
they start something,

00:12:48.827 --> 00:12:51.106
everything we see would be very different.

00:12:51.106 --> 00:12:51.939
- [Karen] Yeah.

00:12:51.939 --> 00:12:53.404
- Dramatically different.

00:12:53.404 --> 00:12:55.503
There's entitlement now that just because

00:12:55.503 --> 00:12:56.969
you showed up and you worked hard

00:12:56.969 --> 00:12:58.617
or you put your heart and
soul into anything like that,

00:12:58.617 --> 00:13:00.127
you're supposed to get something?

00:13:00.127 --> 00:13:02.178
I ran track. Showing up and working hard

00:13:02.178 --> 00:13:04.149
and leaving my heart on the field

00:13:04.149 --> 00:13:06.986
still meant that I could
get tenth or twelfth place,

00:13:06.986 --> 00:13:09.647
or as was normally the
case, second or third.

00:13:09.647 --> 00:13:12.343
But, I wasn't entitled to that.

00:13:12.343 --> 00:13:15.689
If someone beat me, I'm more concerned...

00:13:15.689 --> 00:13:19.186
and here's my other thing,
if I got first place

00:13:19.186 --> 00:13:21.640
but I was 30 seconds
slower than my last race

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:23.732
I was more upset. I'd
rather have the bronze

00:13:23.732 --> 00:13:27.479
or silver or be in eighth
place and be 20 seconds faster,

00:13:27.479 --> 00:13:30.032
than win and be 30 seconds slower.

00:13:30.032 --> 00:13:30.869
- [Evan] Boom!

00:13:30.869 --> 00:13:31.702
- Every time, every time.

00:13:31.702 --> 00:13:32.577
- [Evan] Roberto Blake.

00:13:32.577 --> 00:13:36.744
So it was a lot more fun than anticipated.

00:13:38.027 --> 00:13:39.581
Let's see if I can find my way.

00:13:39.581 --> 00:13:43.786
It's what, one thirty or so
in the morning Toronto time.

00:13:43.786 --> 00:13:46.027
We kind of closed the party.

00:13:46.027 --> 00:13:48.327
Had some good conversations,

00:13:48.327 --> 00:13:51.160
well you can't see me I went dark.

00:13:53.075 --> 00:13:55.104
Had a good chunk of time with Charlie

00:13:55.104 --> 00:13:58.687
from Charisma on Command.
We had met on email

00:13:58.687 --> 00:14:01.879
but hadn't connected in
person and so we connected,

00:14:01.879 --> 00:14:04.374
and had some good business talk.

00:14:04.374 --> 00:14:09.092
Him and his girlfriend
Jessica, good people.

00:14:09.092 --> 00:14:11.042
Ended up closing down the show

00:14:11.042 --> 00:14:14.321
talking entrepreneurship,
it's good, it's good.

00:14:14.321 --> 00:14:17.035
A lot of the people here
are family vloggers,

00:14:17.035 --> 00:14:20.323
not a lot of connection to what I do

00:14:20.323 --> 00:14:23.537
but Charlie, Antonio, Roberto,

00:14:23.537 --> 00:14:26.107
and Tim it's a good group.

00:14:26.107 --> 00:14:27.217
I'm going to get ready for bed,

00:14:27.217 --> 00:14:28.368
the downside was I didn't get to

00:14:28.368 --> 00:14:32.296
say goodnight to Nina. So I missed that

00:14:32.296 --> 00:14:35.419
I'm kind of sad about it
but we're going to have

00:14:35.419 --> 00:14:37.617
breakfast tomorrow at eight

00:14:37.617 --> 00:14:40.429
and then head off for a fun day of

00:14:40.429 --> 00:14:42.096
whatever we're doing tomorrow.

00:14:42.096 --> 00:14:45.126
So I'm back, I'm going
to put on CNN. Yeah!

00:14:45.126 --> 00:14:47.324
(laughter)

00:14:47.324 --> 00:14:50.991
Get ready for bed, and
I'll see ya tomorrow.

